      "source_index": 3,
      "text": "A drone view captures waves crashing against rugged cliffs at Big Sur\u2019s Garay Point beach. Blue waters with white-tipped waves meet the golden light of the setting sun, illuminating the rocky shore and casting long shadows. A distant lighthouse on a small island pierces the twilight. Green shrubbery covers the cliff\u2019s edge, and the steep drop from the road to the beach is dramatic. The camera angle provides a bird's-eye view, showcasing the raw beauty and rugged landscape. The scene is bathed in a warm, golden hue, highlighting textures and details."
    },
    {
      "effective_seed": 21119,
      "path": "/apdcephfs_gy2/share_302533218/cedricnie/v211_runs/v211_lphc_9a1c352bd6d0594587acb3afdc0648a2c8a18730_sixnode/inputs/prompts/source_019.txt",
