      "source_index": 19,
      "text": "A stunning aerial photograph captured from a drone, circling around a majestic historic church perched atop a rocky outcropping along the Amalfi Coast. The camera captures intricate architectural details and tiered pathways and patios adorned with lush greenery, with waves crashing against the rocks below. The view extends to the horizon, showcasing coastal waters and rolling hills. Distant figures leisurely walk and enjoy the dramatic ocean views from the patios. The warm afternoon sun bathes the scene in a magical and romantic light, creating a breathtaking and serene atmosphere. High-resolution, detailed quality highlights every texture and color. Wide-angle shot from a dynamic aerial perspective."
    },
    {
